+# Fetching this corpus
+
+Files were fetched via Svipall, which enforces a per-domain rate limit:
+
+- **12 visits per 60 s window**, per domain.
+- Breaching it triggers a **900 s (15 min) cooldown** before that domain is usable again.
+
+## Mirror / CDN hosts used
+
+- `raw.githubusercontent.com` — primary source; confirmed by `manifest.tsv`'s header, which
+  records files as "fetched raw via raw.githubusercontent.com".
+- `cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/<owner>/<repo>@<branch>/<path>` — fallback mirror.
+- `cdn.statically.io` — fallback mirror; noted as slow / prone to timeouts.
+
+Source: session record (muninn episode, 2026-09-13, trust level 1 — observed in this
+project's own transcript). No separate fetch log or script in this repo pins these
+numbers independently; if that matters, re-check against the actual fetch script/log
+before relying on the exact figures.
